  mean gap above the exact ground state, all problems and seeds:
            sensed    0.8549  +- 0.2744
         sens+diag    0.6087  +- 0.1998
        exact+diag    0.4457  +- 0.1521

  sens+diag ~ sensed means curvature does not help THIS optimiser, and the
  k-fold Hadamard test has nothing to buy here. exact+diag ~ sensed too
  means the ceiling is the LANDSCAPE, not the estimator, and no amount of
  second-order information helps - which is what T6's degree accounting
  (deg1+deg2 = 99.6%, gradient already at cos 0.977) would predict.
  Only a clear win for sens+diag reopens the k-fold HT as worth building.
